    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "51f3424c_993ed293",
        "filename": "telephony/java/com/android/internal/telephony/IccLogicalChannelRequest.aidl",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 27,
      "author": {
        "id": 1124543
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-11-18T01:50:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Suggest making this `@JavaOnlyImmutable` as well, then we just specify everything in the ctor and fields are declared `final`. No more \u0027A a \u003d new A(); a.b \u003d X; a.c \u003d Y; a.d \u003d Z; ...` pattern that way",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 27,
        "startChar": 11,
        "endLine": 27,
        "endChar": 35
      },
      "revId": "93f368561fe43cbd8862e97924146f6cf5759a3c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6e8b7fe3_cf3b8bf3",
        "filename": "telephony/java/com/android/internal/telephony/IccLogicalChannelRequest.aidl",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 27,
      "author": {
        "id": 1609802
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-11-18T19:33:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, @JavaOnlyImmutable is one of four options discussed here:\nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1PXd3RDxWx3D9g8EBnfhR591FDnrC8aH8arHzCQL1l_I/edit#\n\nAlternative 3 with patch at https://android-review.googlesource.com/q/topic:sim_itelephony_pass_immutable explored this option. \n\nThe drawbacks are:\n1. Our binder object here is NOT allow in immutable parcelable and we have to pass it separately (e.g. as the additional parameter to ITelephony API)...\n2. We can only put input parameter. When we open channel, channel ID can not retrieve later, even we put here, it is not modifiable at all.\n\nDiscussed with Nathan, the mutable solution (Alternative 4) is picked. All infos are put into the mutable parcelable with a flat structure which may not the best organized but support all scenarios without any boilerplate.",
      "parentUuid": "51f3424c_993ed293",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 27,
        "startChar": 11,
        "endLine": 27,
        "endChar": 35
      },
      "revId": "93f368561fe43cbd8862e97924146f6cf5759a3c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
