      },
      "lineNbr": 27,
      "author": {
        "id": 1609802
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-11-18T19:33:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, let\u0027s leave this for Chen/Tyler to see their preference.\n\nCurrently it is defined separately with one reason that it not only used to serve as the parameter of IccOpen/CloseLogicalChannel but also as the data wrapper to send to hander thread of PhoneInterfaceManager.",
      "parentUuid": "bef264bc_5d57209d",
